1
00:00:00,214 --> 00:00:02,614
it's true, but let's-let's
consider for a moment

2
00:00:02,617 --> 00:00:05,087
(Stuart:)that possibly I'm the problem.
Yeah.

3
00:00:05,086 --> 00:00:06,356
(Stuart:)You are.
You can say it.

4
00:00:06,354 --> 00:00:07,924
Okay, fine. What...?

5
00:00:07,922 --> 00:00:09,452
(Stuart:)I mean, what
can I do?

6
00:00:09,457 --> 00:00:11,257
(Stuart:)I get so nervous
around women.

7
00:00:11,259 --> 00:00:12,729
(Penny:)Well, you're talking
to us now.

8
00:00:12,727 --> 00:00:14,157
(Penny:)I mean, you don't seem nervous.

9
00:00:14,162 --> 00:00:15,762
(Sheldon:)Well, that's
'cause I'm doing that trick

10
00:00:15,763 --> 00:00:18,393
(Stuart:)where you imagine
the audience is naked.

11
00:00:20,467 --> 00:00:23,007
(Stuart:)By the way, thumbs up, ladies.

12
00:00:24,070 --> 00:00:26,570
(Amy:)Do you not hear
how creepy that sounds?

13
00:00:26,574 --> 00:00:28,504
(laughing):
It was a joke.

14
00:00:28,509 --> 00:00:29,679
(Bernadette:)Was it?

15
00:00:29,677 --> 00:00:31,477
(Stuart:)No, I'm still doing it.

16
00:00:31,479 --> 00:00:34,379
(Penny:)Okay.

17
00:00:34,382 --> 00:00:36,352
(Penny:)Don't be offended, but...

18
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:38,680
(Penny:)what went wrong with you?

19
00:00:38,686 --> 00:00:43,226
I-I guess I assumed
at this point in my life,

20
00:00:43,224 --> 00:00:46,354
(Stuart:)I would be married
or in a relationship,

21
00:00:46,360 --> 00:00:47,790
(Stuart:)or even have a pet

22
00:00:47,795 --> 00:00:50,495
(Stuart:)that didn't run away
or kill itself.

23
00:00:51,364 --> 00:00:53,264
(Bernadette:)That really happened?

24
00:00:53,267 --> 00:00:55,597
(Stuart:)I mean, I can't say for sure,
but I swear

25
00:00:55,603 --> 00:00:57,473
(Stuart:)that rabbit looked me
right in the eye

26
00:00:57,471 --> 00:00:59,601
(Stuart:)before it hopped
in front of that car.

27
00:00:59,606 --> 00:01:01,476
(Stuart:)Anyway,

